# AGENTS.md describes in prose. Last matching entry wins.
# Order: global defaults, then per-area owners.
# NOTE: @TrayambakMaintainers is a placeholder — swap in the real GitHub
# handle/team before pushing (GitHub ignores owners it cannot resolve).

# Default: any change needs a maintainer review.
* @TrayambakMaintainers

